{"instruction":"For each requested answer sentence emit index|E/C/B|p_unsupported with two decimals|[zero to two source segment indices]. One record per line in input order; no other text. Relations and addresses are predictions.","source":"{"address":"211 Helena Ave","attributes":{"Ambience":{"casual":true,"classy":true,"divey":false,"hipster":true,"intimate":false,"romantic":false,"touristy":false,"trendy":true,"upscale":false},"BusinessParking":{"garage":null,"lot":true,"street":true,"valet":false,"validated":false},"Music":false,"OutdoorSeating":true,"RestaurantsGoodForGroups":true,"RestaurantsReservations":false,"RestaurantsTakeOut":null,"WiFi":"no"},"business_stars":4.5,"categories":"Nightlife, Bars, Tiki Bars, Cocktail Bars","city":"Santa Barbara","hours":{"Friday":"14:0-2:0","Monday":"16:0-1:0","Saturday":"14:0-2:0","Sunday":"14:0-1:0","Thursday":"16:0-1:0","Tuesday":"16:0-1:0","Wednesday":"16:0-1:0"},"name":"Test Pilot","review_info":[{"review_date":"2022-01-17 17:30:36","review_stars":4.0,"review_text":"This place has pretty good tiki cocktails but I wouldn't say this is a tiki bar more nautical themed. We got the buccaneer, which comes in a young coconut, and the Thai iced tiki. I wasn't a fan of the Thai iced tiki. I thought the all spice was a little overpowering but it was still a fun drink with the popping liquid pearls on top. The buccaneer was also fresh and I liked that it was in a coconut because we were able to eat as a side snack!"},{"review_date":"2022-01-15 21:13:30","review_stars":4.0,"review_text":"This was a really fun bar to go to. Great crowd on a Sunday funday. They have nice outdoor seating. Drink prices are reasonable and taste phenomenal. Perfect for a date or a fun hang."},{"review_date":"2022-01-06 02:49:11","review_stars":5.0,"review_text":"Stumbled upon this bar Sunday around 3pm while we were exploring Funkzone; it was relatively empty so we were able to sit wherever we wanted. \n\nThe bartender is knowledgeable and accommodating, the cups for cocktails are very instagram-able if that's your thing, and the decor is well thought out with open-air beach vibes. \n\nThe drink list is LONG and had something for everyone in our group- strong drinks, creative drinks, and twist on classic drinks. \n\nDefinitely recommend a pit stop here if you're in the mood for a creative cocktail!"}],"state":"CA"}","answer":"Test Pilot is a nightlife business located at 211 Helena Ave in Santa Barbara, CA. The business offers a variety of services including bars, tiki bars, and cocktail bars. The hours of operation vary depending on the day of the week, with Monday through Saturday open from 4 pm to 1 am, and Sunday open from 4 pm to 1 am.

Customers have praised the bar's selection of tiki cocktails, particularly the Buccaneer and Thai Iced Tiki. The outdoor seating area has been described as comfortable and inviting, making it a great spot for a date or a fun hangout. The drink prices have also been noted as reasonable and the cocktails have a unique and delicious taste.

