{"instruction":"For each requested answer sentence emit index|E/C/B|p_unsupported with two decimals|[zero to two source segment indices]. One record per line in input order; no other text. Relations and addresses are predictions.","source":"{"address":"5666 Calle Real","attributes":{"Ambience":{"casual":true,"classy":false,"divey":false,"hipster":false,"intimate":false,"romantic":false,"touristy":false,"trendy":false,"upscale":false},"BusinessParking":{"garage":false,"lot":true,"street":false,"valet":false,"validated":false},"Music":null,"OutdoorSeating":true,"RestaurantsGoodForGroups":true,"RestaurantsReservations":false,"RestaurantsTakeOut":true,"WiFi":"no"},"business_stars":3.5,"categories":"Sandwiches, Delis, Restaurants, Soup, Salad, Food","city":"Goleta","hours":{"Friday":"10:0-16:0","Monday":"10:0-16:0","Saturday":"10:0-16:0","Sunday":"11:0-15:0","Thursday":"10:0-16:0","Tuesday":"10:0-16:0","Wednesday":"10:0-16:0"},"name":"Panino","review_info":[{"review_date":"2021-04-22 19:38:05","review_stars":5.0,"review_text":"Okay, this was not exactly what I expected, but its a delightful surprise!! I decided to try something new and go with the English Stilton and pear sandwich today...I don't know why, but I assumed the cranberries and walnuts would be in a kind of chutney so when I opened my sandwich I was kind of disappointed until I took a bite. HOLY COW ITS DELICIOUS! Everyone should try this sandwich on Foccacia bread!\n\nClassic faves of mine also include the Turkey and Salami, Cobb Salad Sandwich, and Caprese Sandwich. I've honestly never had anything that I didn't like. Thanks for another delicious lunch today, Panino!"},{"review_date":"2021-01-27 23:52:51","review_stars":5.0,"review_text":"A couple of months ago my wife and I had to do some business in Goleta. When we were done we asked where we could get a good sandwich. They recommended Panino. It was great!! Today my wife and I were bored from staying at home cause of the pandemic. We decided to take a drive to Goleta and have lunch at Panino. Again, our sandwiches/lunch were great. Very friendly and good service. Take it from us who drive all the way from Oxnard. Highly recommended!!"},{"review_date":"2020-12-04 04:09:52","review_stars":5.0,"review_text":"Depending on my taste buds for the day, Panino has either the best or the 2nd best sandwich in town. That would be the Italian combo on focaccia. Layered with fine meats and cheeses, it's thoughtfully complemented by a delightful basil aioli, lettuce, and thin cut green bell pepper and cucumber. If one maneuvers the meat and cheese correctly, every bite has the most appealing ratio of ingredients you will ever taste in a sandwich. It's like taking a bite out of the Sistine Chapel, or being able to taste the Mona Lisa. If they ever change it, I will seriously write a strongly worded letter to management. \n\nIf I ever were to try any of their other sandwiches, I'm assuming they would also be delicious. The prices are a bit more than average, much as the price of a Lakers ticket costs more than one for the Clippers."}],"state":"CA"}","answer":"Panino is a local business located at 5666 Calle Real in Goleta, CA. This establishment specializes in sandwiches and deli-style food. They also offer soup, salad, and other restaurant dishes. The business operates from 10:00 AM to 4:00 PM from Monday to Friday, and from 10:00 AM to 4:00 PM on Saturdays. On Sundays, Panino opens from 11:00 AM to 3:00 PM. 

Customers have left positive reviews about the food and service provided by Panino. One customer mentioned being pleasantly surprised by the English Stilton and pear sandwich, praising its taste and recommending it to others. They also expressed satisfaction with other sandwiches like the Turkey and Salami, Cobb Salad Sandwich, and Caprese Sandwich. Another customer, who had driven from Oxnard, highly recommended Panino for its great sandwiches and friendly service. A third customer praised the Italian combo sandwich on focaccia, highlighting the delicious combination of meats, cheeses, and basil aioli. They expressed a strong preference for this sandwich and mentioned that the prices are slightly higher than average.

Overall, Panino is a local business in Goleta known for its delicious sandwiches, friendly service, and a variety of options on their menu.","source_segments":[{"index":0,"byte_start":0,"byte_end":873},{"index":1,"byte_start":873,"byte_end":1129},{"index":2,"byte_start":1129,"byte_end":1153},{"index":3,"byte_start":1153,"byte_end":1310},{"index":4,"byte_start":1310,"byte_end":1363},{"index":5,"byte_start":1363,"byte_end":1558},{"index":6,"byte_start":1558,"byte_end":1621},{"index":7,"byte_start":1621,"byte_end":1646},{"index":8,"byte_start":1646,"byte_end":1661},{"index":9,"byte_start":1661,"byte_end":1736},{"index":10,"byte_start":1736,"byte_end":1799},{"index":11,"byte_start":1799,"byte_end":1839},{"index":12,"byte_start":1839,"byte_end":1871},{"index":13,"byte_start":1871,"byte_end":1922},{"index":14,"byte_start":1922,"byte_end":2117},{"index":15,"byte_start":2117,"byte_end":2162},{"index":16,"byte_start":2162,"byte_end":2313},{"index":17,"byte_start":2313,"byte_end":2451},{"index":18,"byte_start":2451,"byte_end":2540},{"index":19,"byte_start":2540,"byte_end":2627},{"index":20,"byte_start":2627,"byte_end":2727},{"index":21,"byte_start":2727,"byte_end":2858}],"answer_sentence_indices":[0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7],"answer_offsets":[{"index":0,"byte_start":0,"byte_end":69},{"index":1,"byte_start":69,"byte_end":135},{"index":2,"byte_start":135,"byte_end":193},{"index":3,"byte_start":193,"byte_end":306},{"index":4,"byte_start":306,"byte_end":359},{"index":5,"byte_start":359,"byte_end":443},{"index":6,"byte_start":443,"byte_end":585},{"index":7,"byte_start":585,"byte_end":711},{"index":8,"byte_start":711,"byte_end":830},{"index":9,"byte_start":830,"byte_end":970},{"index":10,"byte_start":970,"byte_end":1088},{"index":11,"byte_start":1088,"byte_end":1227}]}

